{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01XeN7vR1b2tnD8DJSoE3xmd","type":"tool_result","content":"{\"result\":\"{\\\"success\\\": true, \\\"data\\\": {\\\"path\\\": \\\"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-prod42/projects/clkc_mech_interp/ROADMAP.md\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"# clkc_mech_interp — Research Dashboard\\\\n\\\\n> 最后更新: 2026-05-22 02:38 UTC | 更新原因: MVP 通过，进入 Research 阶段，Dream 已提交\\\\n\\\\n## 核心方向\\\\n多语言 LLM 中跨语言知识冲突的机制可解释性研究。核心发现：冲突信号可线性检测，跨语言迁移存在方向性不对称（~7.2pp），跨架构一致。目标 ICLR 2027（DDL 2026-09-24）。详见 paper_framing.md。\\\\n\\\\n## 当前阶段：Research（MVP 已通过 ✅）\\\\n\\\\nMVP 通过条件：双模型探针验证 + 两个 confounder 排除（token overlap + COMET ablation）。\\\\n\\\\n### 双模型 Bootstrap n=100 结果（可引用）\\\\n\\\\n| 方向 | Llama-3.1-8B (mean±std) | Qwen3-8B (mean±std) |\\\\n|------|------------------------|---------------------|\\\\n| EN→EN | **77.1±1.2%** | **75.3±1.7%** |\\\\n| ZH→ZH | **71.2±1.3%** | **71.6±1.8%** |\\\\n| EN→ZH | **64.1±2.5%** | **65.0±2.7%** |\\\\n| ZH→EN | **71.3±2.7%** | **72.2±2.6%** |\\\\n\\\\n不对称性 (corrected): Llama +7.22pp CI [1.1%, 13.6%] sig | Qwen +7.18pp CI [-1.2%, 13.4%] trending\\\\n\\\\n### Confounder 排除\\\\n- **RC1 翻译质量**: plan_105 COMET tercile ablation → delta=-5.64pp (反向), p=0.695, 非 confounder ✅\\\\n- **RC2 Token overlap**: plan_101 → per-sample Jaccard 3-4%, Llama 负相关 r=-0.15, 非 confounder ✅\\\\n\\\\n### 近期任务\\\\n- [x] ~~complete_mvp()~~ ✅\\\\n- [ ] dream_simulate(review_mode=\\\\\\\"full\\\\\\\") — dream_20260522T023801 pending (10-25 min)\\\\n- [ ] Llama test COMET 完成后跑 Llama 版 tercile ablation（确认一致性）\\\\n- [ ] COMET train 继续跑（Qwen ~3.8h, Llama ~7h）\\\\n- [ ] Dream 完成后审阅 → 批准 P0 实验启动\\\\n\\\\n### Post-MVP P0 实验（等 Dream 审阅后启动）\\\\n1. ~~Token overlap (plan_101)~~ ✅\\\\n2. ~~Bootstrap CI 修正 (plan_099)~~ ✅\\\\n3. ~~COMET tercile ablation (plan_105)~~ ✅ (Qwen done, Llama pending)\\\\n4. 第三模型 Gemma-2-9B-IT (plan_102) — 模型已下载, 等 GPU\\\\n5. 多语言扩展 EN↔JA (plan_103) — planned, ~20 GPU·h\\\\n6. Layer-wise CKA/SVCCA (plan_104) — planned, ~4 GPU·h\\\\n7. Representation steering (plan_107) — planned, ~8 GPU·h\\\\n\\\\n## GPU 预算\\\\nwestd-41302: 4× RTX PRO 6000 Blackwell 96GB（cuda:0-3）\\\\n当前: cuda:0,2 COMET train; cuda:3 COMET Llama test; cuda:1 空闲\\\\n\\\\n## 风险\\\\n1. Llama CI 下界 borderline (1.1pp) — 第三模型 Gemma 结果决定 C2 强度\\\\n2. 只有 Track 1 时论文贡献可能偏 analysis paper — Dream 审稿将评估\\\\n3. COMET train 仍需 4-8h 完成\\\\n\\\\n## 关键决策日志\\\\n\\\\n| ID | 日期 | 摘要 | 关联实验 |\\\\n|----|------|------|----------|\\\\n| D006 | 2026-05-22 | COMET 0.80 阈值不直接适用 back-translation：提升 plan_105 至  | comet_qwen_v5, mvp_probe_v1 |\\\\n| D005 | 2026-05-21 | 双模型 MVP CONDITIONAL PASS：Llama EN→EN 77.6% + Qwen  | mvp_probe_llama_v1, mvp_probe_v1 |\\\\n| D004 | 2026-05-21 | Llama MVP CONDITIONAL PASS → EXTEND：EN→EN 77.6%, 跨 | mvp_probe_llama_v1 |\\\\n| D003 | 2026-05-21 | 补采样至 2000 条 + 取消强制交集，每个模型用各自 verified 数据集 | mvp_probe_llama_v1 |\\\\n| D002 | 2026-05-21 | 采纳 Reviewer 5 条 warning，细化 MVP gate：增加 70-79% cond | — |\\\\n| D001 | 2026-05-21 | MVP 方案：EN+ZH 双语探针迁移实验验证跨语言冲突信号可检测性 | — |\\\\n\\\\n\\\\n\\\", \\\"total_chars\\\": 2474, \\\"truncated\\\": false}, \\\"error\\\": null, \\\"metadata\\\": {}}\"}"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01K1yU3KRea1dw94pQzszMvB","session_id":"d76881f3-8cf2-45f7-8657-e72190e5783a","uuid":"07324267-4c6f-40ae-869a-d46f04cda9ab","timestamp":"2026-05-22T03:12:46.967Z"}
