e result: defines boundary conditions for when SAE steering\\\\n      works. Our Track 3 design addresses their methodological gaps.'\\\\n    abstract: ''\\\\n    semantic_scholar_id: ''\\\\n    verified: true\\\\n    added_by: director-bootstrap\\\\n    added_at: '2026-05-21T12:04:50.273Z'\\\\n\\\", \\\"total_chars\\\": 7107, \\\"truncated\\\": false}, \\\"error\\\": null, \\\"metadata\\\": {}}\"}"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01K1yU3KRea1dw94pQzszMvB","session_id":"d76881f3-8cf2-45f7-8657-e72190e5783a","uuid":"d9f39cb1-5bdd-4ad5-a0cc-3987afdd66ea","timestamp":"2026-05-22T03:12:48.772Z"}
